_pdbx_database_remark.text   
;SEQUENCE
THERE ARE TWO NATURALLY OCCURING SEQUENCE VARIANTS P116D AND T212S
FOR EQUINATOXIN II 
P116D VARIANT OCCURS IN 50% OF MOLECULES FROM ACTINIA EQUINA
AND THE T212S VARIANT IN ACTINA TENEBROSA.
;
